  "content": "[Intro]\n[Bbadd13]Is this the real life?\n[C7]Is this [Bbadd13]just [C7]fantasy?\n[F7]Caught in a [F7][Cm7]landslide, no es-\n[Bb]cape from [Bb][C7]reality.\n[Gm7]Open your eyes, look\n[Bb7]up to the skies and [Eb]see.\n[Eb/D]\n[Cm7]I'm just a poor boy,\n[F7]I need no sympathy.\n[B]Easy [Bb]come, [A]easy [B]go.\n[B]Little [Bb]high, [A]little [Bb]low.\n[Eb]Anyway the [Bb/D]wind blows,\n[Edim]doesn't really [F/C]matter to\nme, to\n[Bbadd13]me.\n\n[Verse 1]\n[Bbadd13]Mama, just\n[Gm7]killed a man. Put a\n[Cm9]gun against his head, pulled my\n[Cm7]trigger, now he's dead. [F/C]\n[Bbadd13]Mama, life had\n[Gm7]just begun, but\n[Cm7]now I've gone and [Bbaug]thrown it [Eb/Bb]all a-\n[Bm7]way. [Abmaj7][Eb/G]\n[Eb]Mama, [Bb/D]ooh,\n[Cm7]didn't\n[Fm]mean to make you cry [Ab/Eb][D]If\n[Bb]I'm not back again this [Bb7]time tomorr-\n[Eb]ow, carry [Bb/D]on, carry\n[Cm]on, as if [Abm]nothing really mat-\n[Eb]ters\n\n[Interlude]\n[Ab/Eb]  [Eb]\n[Bbadd13]\n\n[Verse 2]\n[Bbadd13]Too late, my\n[Gm7]time has come. Sends\n[Cm]shivers down my spine, body's\n[Cm7]aching all the time. [F7]\n[Bbadd13]Goodbye everybody, I've\n[Gm7]got to go. Gotta\n[Cm7]leave you all behind [Bbaug]and face [Eb/Bb]\n[Bm7]the truth. [Abmaj7][Eb/G]\n[Eb]Mama, [Eb/D]ooh,\n[Cm7]\n[Fm]I don't wanna die, [Ab/Eb]I\n[Bb]sometimes wish I'd [Bb7]never been born at all.\n\n[Solo]\n[Eb]  [Eb/D]\n[Cmadd9]\n[Fm]  [Eaug]  [Ab/Eb]  [Ab(b5)]\n[Bb]  [Bb7]\n[Eb]  [Bb/D]\n[Cmadd9]\n[Fm]  [Eaug]  [Ab/Eb]  [Ab(b5)]\n[Db]  [Db/B]\n\n[Interlude]\n[A]\n\n[Bridge]\n[D]I [A]see a [Adim]little [A]silhou-\n[D]etto [A]of a [Adim]man. [A]Scara-\n[D]mouch, [D][A]Scaramouch, [A]will you\n[Adim]do the [A][D][A]fandango?\n[Db]Thunderbolt and [Ab]lightning,\n[C]very very [E7]frightening\n[A]me. Galileo,\nGalileo,\nGalileo, Figa-\n[Cm7]ro. Mangnifi-\nco\n[B]I'm [Bb]just a [B]poor [Bb]boy,\n[Bb][B]nobody [B]loves [Bb]me.\n[Ab]He's [Eb]just a [Ebdim]poor [Eb]boy,\n[Ab]from a [Eb]poor [Eb][Ebdim]family;\n[Ab]Spare him his life from this\n[Bb/D][F7/Eb][F]monstrosity\n[Bb]\n\n[Break]\n[B]Easy [Bb]come, [A]easy [Bb]go,\n[B]will you [Bb]let me [A]go? Bis-\n\n[Bridge 2]\nmillah! [Eb]No! We\n[Eb]will not [Bb7]let you [Eb]go! Let him go!\nBismillah!\n[Eb]Will not [Bb7]let you [Eb]go! Let him go!\nBismillah! We\n[Eb]will not [Bb7]let you [Eb]go! Let me go!\n[Eb]Will not [Bb7]let you [Eb]go, let me go!\n[Eb]Will not [Bb7]let you [Eb]go, let me go-\nohohoh, ohohoh. [Gb7]Aah...\n[Bm]No [A]no [D]no [Db]no,\n[Gb]no [Bb]no [Eb]no! Oh mama-\nmia, mamamia, [Eb]mama-\n[Eb][Ab]mia let me go! Be-\n[Ab][Eb]elzebub, has a\n[D7]Devil put [Gm7]a-side for\n[A7]me, for\nme, for\nme\n\n[Bridge]\n[D7]\n[F]\n\n[Chorus]\n[Bb]So you think you can\nstone me and [Eb]spit in my\n[Bb]eye?\n[Db]\n[Bb]So you think you can\nlove me and [Eb]leave me to\n[Ab]die? [Gm]\n[Fm]Oh\n[Bb]baby,\n[Fm]can't do this to me\n[Bb]baby.\n[Fm]Just gotta get out, [Bb]\n[Fm]just gotta get [Bb]right outta'\n\n[Bridge]\n[Eb]here.\n[F]\n[F#]  [Ab]\n[B7]\n[A7]\n[Bb7]\n\n[Outro]\n[Eb]  [Bb]\n[Cm]  [G7]  [Cm]\n[G7]  [Cm]  [Bb]  [Eb]\n[D]  [Gm]\n[Bb]\n[Cm]Nothing really [Gm]matters.\n[Cm]Anyone can [Gm]see.\n[Cm]Nothing really [Abm]matters.\n[Ab/Eb]Nothing really matters to\n[Eb]me. [Ab/Eb]\n[Eb]  [Ebdim]\n[Bb/D]  [Bbm/C]\n[C]  [Bbdim]\n[C7]  [F]\n[Bb/F]Any [F]way the [Abdim][C7]\nwind blows.\n[F]",
